\caption{Tangent space excitation for 2D TFI model on a $N=4\times 4$ square lattice. Here all data are computed with a $n=2$ ansatz, with basis in all layers included. %The ground state is obtained by applying a depth $D=16$ HVA ansatz with initial state $|\Psi_0\rangle=|+\rangle^{\otimes N}$. 
In (a) we compare the lowest five levels with ED, finding good agreement across the phase transition. In (b), we further show with an example at parameter $g=3$ (close to the critical point) that many of the low energy levels can be captured with this ansatz.}
