    The bifurcating numerical solution is symmetric and periodic with respect to a fundamental domain with double edge length. Therefore, this indicates a period-doubling bifurcation.
    Once more, the continuation of the secondary branch terminates close to film rupture ($\min_{\Omega^{\textrm{num}}} v=-0.9925$).
