 \hat{\tau}+ \tau^* & \geq \frac{c}{4}\left((\ell+r)(\ell+r-1)+\sum_{\alpha =1}^{3}\left( \sum_{i=1}^{\ell} 6\lVert B_{J_\alpha}X_i \rVert ^{2}+3 \lVert C_{J_\alpha}X_{1} \rVert ^{2}\right) \right) \\ & -r^2\|H\|^2+2 \delta(N)-2\left\|{\mathcal{T}}^{\mathcal{V}}\right\|^2,
