%     % In particular, Theorem $\ref{UFD theorem}$ establishes an inclusion preserving bijective correspondence between prime ideals of $A$ containing $\psi(x) \cap A$ and prime ideals of $B$ containing $\psi(x)$ for all $x \in X$ with $\Ht(x)=1$.
