 The integral form of the hodograph transformation (\ref{9}) and the summation form of the discrete hodograph transformation (\ref{dishodographMCSP}) can be expressed by the $\tau$ function as
 \begin{eqnarray}
 x=X-2(\log{f})_{T},
 \end{eqnarray}
 \begin{eqnarray}
 x_{l}=2al-2(\log{f_{l}})_{T}.
  \end{eqnarray}
