only  $\phi_{1}(s) = \sum_i \sigma_i$ is relevant and $\bar \phi_1(\hat \bs)$ %$ = M^{-1}\sum^{M,N}_{l,j=1} \hat \sigma^l_j$ 
converges to $\pm N$, with (see Appendix~\ref{appA})
\begin{equation}
