\section{Conclusion}

The main open question remaining is whether it is possible to obtain an algorithm with approximation ratio $0.5(k+1)$, or whether this is UGC-Hard. We are unaware of any instances with integrality gap above $0.5(k+1)$, so improving this bound is also of interest. Another open problem is whether it is NP-Hard to obtain an $O(1)$ approximation for \DED. 

