$\phi_{n}\colon \Z^{2}\to (n^{1/2}\Z)\times (n^{-1/2}\Z)$ for $n = a, a+2$.

\subsection{\texorpdfstring
{\boldmath Example for $\alpha = [3, \bar{2}]$}
